// #2914: a chunked `vibe grep` sweep answers exactly what an unchunked one
// does. `deps { selfhostGeneration }` and the env override because the chunk
// path needs a compiler that understands `grep --list-files` -- against an
// older one the driver falls back to the single call, and the gate would
