// Phase 2 of the selfhost Perceus RC port (docs/spec/selfhost-rc-port.md):
// unit-test the ported analysis pass in isolation via the native vibe CLI.

// Phase 1 safety net for the selfhost RC port (docs/spec/selfhost-rc-port.md):
// compile heap-object source programs with the selfhost backend, run them on
// wasmtime, and check results — locks current heap layouts before the uniform
// object-header change.

// Reliable verification loop for the selfhost Perceus RC work (ADR-0055):
