// pure-test result cache is never stale) AND asserts RC reclamation is ~0
// bytes/iter for tuple/record/enum/array. See the script header for the
// caching/sandbox traps this avoids.

// ADR-0055 #493: whole-compiler self-compile through stage1, both backends,
// asserting RC-vs-default parity (RC adds no compile gap at full compiler scale).
